 {"q": "What is the main purpose of the noble lie, in Plato's words?", "options": ["To deceive enemies in war", "To make the citizens care more for the city and one another, and accept their places", "To keep the rulers in power for life", "To hide the existence of the forms from the people"], "answer": 1, "why": "Socrates says the belief 'will make them care more for the city and for one another'. Critics think it also keeps rulers in power, but that is not the reason Plato gives."},
